TIProjectTemplate.displayName.IPBoost_Project_DirectedInvestmentReform=Directed Investment Reform
TIProjectTemplate.summary.IPBoost_Project_DirectedInvestmentReform=We overhaul how our agents steer national spending, so that every point of economic surplus we touch returns several times over, and our yards turn that surplus into hulls faster than anyone thought possible.
TIProjectTemplate.description.IPBoost_Project_DirectedInvestmentReform=A repeatable program. Each completion permanently increases the Investment Points our control points direct into every national priority and shortens the time our shipyards need to build a ship. Both bonuses stack with every repeat, and only our own faction benefits.
